%% showcase: treemap of an engineering budget
%% prose: Each leaf's area is its share of the total; sections carry their summed value in the header and nest their leaves inside. The highlighted leaf takes its colour from a classDef.
%% approx: Leaves are outlined in their section's colour rather than filled with it.
%% approx: Values are shown as written, without mermaid's valueFormat.
treemap-beta
title Engineering budget (k$)
"Platform"
    "Compute": 420
    "Storage": 180
    "Network": 90
"Product"
    "Web": 260
    "Mobile": 210:::focus
    "Design": 80
"Tooling"
    "CI": 70
    "Observability": 60
"Training": 40
classDef focus fill:#f9d77e,stroke:#9a6700
